<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/assets/favicon.svg">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400..700;1,400..700&family=Montserrat:ital,wght@0,100..900;1,100..900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="preload" href="/assets/img/hero_section_bg.webp" as="image">
    <title>Jireh</title>

    <!-- SEO -->
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://designwithamy.com/assets/logo.svg">
    <meta property="og:image:width" content="500">
    <meta property="og:image:height" content="500">
    <meta property="og:image:type" content="image/webp">
    <meta name="description" content="I designed and developed the website for Jireh, a supplier of recycled materials. I built the site from scratch and integrated three languages to ensure it's accessible to a wider audience">
    <meta name="title" content="Amy - Web Designer & Developer | Custom Websites | Jireh Project">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://jirehrecycle.com">
    <meta property="og:title" content="Amy - Web Designer & Developer | Custom Websites | Jireh Project">
    <meta property="og:description" content="I designed and developed the website for Jireh, a supplier of recycled materials. I built the site from scratch and integrated three languages to ensure it's accessible to a wider audience">

</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/nav') %>
    <main class="md-padding">
        <section class="project__content">
            <p class="heading-tertiary text-center">
                PROJECT SHOWCASE
            </p>
            <h2 class="heading-secondary text-center">
                JIREH PROJECT
            </h2>
            <p class="paragraph">
                I designed and developed the website for Jireh, 
                a supplier of recycled materials. I built the site 
                from scratch and included three languages to make 
                it easier for more people to access. However, 
                their hosting service didn't support Node.js, which 
                I originally planned to use for the language features. 
                Because of that, I ended up creating two versions: one 
                with Node.js as a case study and another without it for 
                their official site. I'll share both links below.
            </p>
            <div class="tag">
                <ul class="tag__list">
                    <li class="tag__item">figma</li>
                    <li class="tag__item">html</li>
                    <li class="tag__item">css</li>
                    <li class="tag__item">Javascript</li>
                    <li class="tag__item">sass</li>
                    <li class="tag__item">nodejs</li>
                    <li class="tag__item">Github</li>
                    <li class="tag__item">aws</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
                <div class="btn btn__with-icon">
                    <a href="https://jirehrecycle.com">
                        <span class="left-text">Official Website</span>
                        <span class="right-icon">
                            <img src="/assets/img/arrow_forward.svg" class="arrow-forward-icon" alt="arrow-forward-icon"/>
                        </span>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="btn btn__with-icon sm-margin-left">
                    <a href="https://project1.designwithamy.com">
                        <span class="left-text">Node.js Version</span>
                        <span class="right-icon">
                            <img src="/assets/img/arrow_forward.svg" class="arrow-forward-icon" alt="arrow-forward-icon"/>
                        </span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="project__showcase">

                <img src="/assets/img/jireh_project_full.jpg" class="showcase-img" alt="showcase jireh project image" width="670" height="1554" />
            </div>
        </section>
        <%- include('partials/contact') %>
    </main>
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    <script src="/js/index.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>